{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：20:24 2026-11-24 HKT<br/>發佈時間：20:24 2026-11-24 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：20:24 2026-11-24 HKT</p><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/20fd53937654e8433f6c3c9d8bcba4db/2026-11/2a4662a9-748e-4d24-9660-2705322989da.jpg\"/><p>今日（24日）晚上7時許，警方接獲一名男子報案，指其60多歲妻子在柴灣翠樂邨翠祿樓的寓所內暈倒，昏迷不醒，救援人員趕到現場，證實女子當場死亡，其死因有待驗屍後確定， 警方將案件暫列「屍體發現」處理。</p><p>據了解，現場堆滿雜物，屋內剩餘的空間不多，當時女事主被困在單位內的走廊，不能動彈。</p><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-24T12:43:52.530935+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":224,"images":1,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-24T12:24:26+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-24T12:37:23.425608+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-24T12:37:23.425608+00:00","content_hash":"619beacfa3683d5924b729f7789277e5244ab6085933427f25b235e5a76f5162","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}